blocks.content:
int *p = 0;       // p does not point at anything valid
*p = 42;            // dereferencing it touches an address with no mapping
// the CPU raises a page fault trap
// the OS finds no legal mapping for this address at all
// the OS delivers SIGSEGV, the process is terminated

